     styles/labels.css - the same six declarations written three times. The <dt>
     carries `meta` now. Colour stays: it is deliberately not part of any of the
     three recipes, so the call site decides it. */
  .facts dt { color: var(--c-text-muted); }
  .facts dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: var(--t-body);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--c-text-sub);
