  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .grid--2, .scope, .proof, .bands { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .facts__row { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 4px; }
    .rail__item { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 6px; }
    /* The gate's 84px track has nowhere to go at 350px of content box, so the
       row keeps its name, its source and its verdict and drops the drawing.
       Every word survives; only the geometry changes. The proof card's own
       phone layout, which was declared here AND in crowmark.astro, is now in
